          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham complained to Abimelech about a well which the servants of Abimelech had seized. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimelech said, “I don't know who did this. You didn't tell me about it, and this is the first I have heard of it.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abraham gave some sheep and cattle to Abimelech, and the two of them made an agreement. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham separated seven lambs from his flock, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Abimelech asked him, “Why did you do that?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham answered, “Accept these seven lambs. By doing this, you admit that I am the one who dug this well.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so the place was called Beersheba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21.31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beersheba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name in Hebrew means “Well of the Vow” or “Well of Seven” (see also 26.33).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because it was there that the two of them made a vow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
