          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After they had made this agreement at Beersheba, Abimelech and Phicol went back to Philistia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abraham planted a tamarisk tree in Beersheba and worshipped the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the Everlasting God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham lived in Philistia for a long time.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.34"
            ]
          }
        }
